{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月14日，OpenAI確認，已撤銷獨立機械人研究團隊，並將相關人員重新分配至核心研究和應用業務部門。公司表示，此次調整並不意味着退出機械人領域，而是希望將機械人研發與通用人工智能模型研究進一步整合。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586318.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T20:07:12.650078+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T19:58:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T20:00:23.340882+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T20:00:23.340882+00:00","content_hash":"bce3cafd5da2e79bdea11335e3640ff9889254d01b7f7f598115546cc97f2cf3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}